@startuml editarSemestreGuia-diseño
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Editar Semestre de Guía

actor "DirectorPrograma" as DirectorPrograma
participant "Vista (React)" as Vista
participant "API (FastAPI)" as API
participant "GuiaRepository" as GuiaRepo
participant "Guia" as Guia
database "Base de Datos" as DB

DirectorPrograma -> Vista: introduce semestre, solicita guardar
activate Vista
Vista -> API: PUT /api/v1/guias/{guia_id}/semestre (semestre)
activate API

API -> GuiaRepo: obtener(guia_id)
activate GuiaRepo
GuiaRepo -> DB: SELECT ... FROM guias WHERE id = :guia_id
activate DB
DB --> GuiaRepo: fila Guia
deactivate DB
GuiaRepo --> API: Guia
deactivate GuiaRepo

API -> Guia: actualizar_semestre(semestre)
activate Guia
deactivate Guia

API -> Guia: regenerar_pdf()
activate Guia
note right of Guia: solo si estado == Aprobada;\nactualiza fecha_generacion_pdf, sin cambiar estado.\nGeneración real del archivo fuera de alcance\n(pertenece a generarGuiasPDF(), CU no construido)
deactivate Guia

API -> GuiaRepo: actualizar(guia)
activate GuiaRepo
GuiaRepo -> DB: UPDATE guias SET semestre = ..., fecha_generacion_pdf = ...
activate DB
DB --> GuiaRepo: ok
deactivate DB
GuiaRepo --> API: Guia
deactivate GuiaRepo

API --> Vista: 200 OK (GuiaResponse JSON)
deactivate API
Vista --> DirectorPrograma: semestre actualizado
deactivate Vista

@enduml
